0..75 Comment "//! A rule of a theory that answers a stuck call beside another stuck call."
76..79 Comment "//!"
80..158 Comment "//! The unit rule `band one x <=> x` answers `encode c`. The other endpoint is"
159..235 Comment "//! `encode b`. A reader that takes each stuck call for the same call admits"
236..266 Comment "//! a path that does not hold."
267..270 Comment "//!"
271..348 Comment "//! No rule relates the two calls, and each call has its own argument. So the"
349..398 Comment "//! checker refuses the reflexivity between them."
399..402 Comment "//!"
403..419 Comment "//! - see: #8278"
